                    Kindly check the requirements and terms of work and make
                    sure everything is right.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div
                class="lap:flex lap:items-center px-5 lap:justify-between ph:space-y-[18px] lap:space-y-0 pb-8"
              >
                <p
                  class="text-left font-roboto lap:font-poppins font-regular text-white text-[14px]"
                >
                  Today you makes 12 Activity
                </p>
                <button
                  class="flex items-center justify-center py-[10px] px-5 lap:px-0 w-[146px] lap:w-[139px] h-[38px] bg-button_orange rounded"
                >
                  <p
                    class="text-center text-white font-poppins font-medium text-[14px]"
                  >
                    See All Activity
                  </p>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!--  9 -->
            <div class="text-center border rounded-xl">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-5">
                <div class="font-poppins font-medium text-[16px] text-left">
                  Upcoming schedule
                </div>
                <div
                  class="border rounded flex items-center justify-center min-h-[22px] px-[6px] font-roboto font-regular ph:text-[10px] tab:text-[12px] text-grey_text"
                >
                  <p class="mx-[2px]">Today, 13 Sep 2021</p>
                  <svg class="icon">
                    <use
                      xlink:href="/icons/defs/svg/sprite.css.svg#arrow_down"
                    ></use>
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="px-5">
                <p
